# Normalise line endings to LF in the repository.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout commits CRLF and every macOS or Linux
# contributor sees whole files as changed. Working copies still get native
# endings; only what is stored is normalised.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never normalise, never diff as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.vsix binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# Generated. Collapsed in diffs and marked so language stats ignore it.
package-lock.json linguist-generated=true -diff
